WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.936
We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.005
Now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.639
President Biden
yesterday announced

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:09.475
an additional $200 million
in funds for Ukraine,

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:12.545
which is great, but it's not
enough money to fight a war.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:15.748
It's barely enough money
to make a movie about a war.

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:17.783
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.783 --> 00:00:19.618
That's right,
Ukrainian President Zelenskyy

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:21.888
spoke with lawmakers yesterday
on Capitol Hill

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:24.824
and said, "Keep your weapons.
Just give me this guy."

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.259
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:29.428
President Biden has reportedly
told confidants

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:32.031
that he feels guilty about
his son Hunter's legal issues,

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:35.135
and feels that Hunter wouldn't
be facing criminal prosecutions

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:37.170
if he had not run
for president in 2020.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.371
Hell, with his résumé,
Hunter would probably

00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:41.708
be looking at a spot
in Trump's cabinet.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.276
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.612
[ As Trump ]
"Secretary of parties."

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:46.979
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:48.415
[ Normal voice ]
Former President Trump

00:00:48.415 --> 00:00:51.584
is selling pieces of the suit
he wore during his mugshot.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:54.954
Or for 10 bucks, you can
just go to a Joseph A. Bank

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.756
and get the whole thing.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.756 --> 00:00:58.290
That's right,

00:00:58.290 --> 00:01:00.960
former President Trump
is selling pieces of the suit

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.428
he wore during his mugshot.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.931
You know, like billionaires do.

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:07.933
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:11.103
You think Rupert Murdoch
would sell you his suit?

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:12.538
If he thought
you wanted his suit,

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:15.007
he would burn it
in front of you.

00:01:15.007 --> 00:01:16.275
[ As Murdoch ]
There you go, mate.

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:18.778
Take all the ashes you want!"

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:21.147
[ Normal voice ] CNN hosted
a town-hall event last night

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:22.982
in Iowa with
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:25.885
It's a rare example
of a sentence in which "Iowa"

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.588
is the most interesting word.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.322
The FBI arrested

00:01:30.322 --> 00:01:32.959
an Internet-pornography
personality last week

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:35.894
for allegedly participating
in the attack on the Capitol.

00:01:35.894 --> 00:01:37.897
He was the one who went
in the rear entrance.

00:01:37.897 --> 00:01:41.367
I'm sorry.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:43.036
[ Applause ]

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:44.703
I don't know what happened.
Let me try again.

00:01:44.703 --> 00:01:47.206
I apologize.
The FBI arrested

00:01:47.206 --> 00:01:49.108
an Internet-pornography
personality last week

00:01:49.108 --> 00:01:51.511
for allegedly participating
in the attack on the Capitol.

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:54.948
Well, you didn't get Mike Pence,
but at least one guy was hung.

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:59.552
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.955
Hmm.
We fixed it.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.823
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.823 --> 00:02:07.293
According to new survey,
40% of millennials think

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.162
that couples should talk
about finances

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:11.097
before a relationship
gets serious.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:13.366
Said one millennial couple,
"We're good."

00:02:13.366 --> 00:02:15.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:17.903
In an effort to stop
Smith &amp; Wesson

00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:19.471
from manufacturing
assault rifles,

00:02:19.471 --> 00:02:21.741
a group of Catholic nuns
recently filed a lawsuit

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:23.976
against the gunmaker,
but only because they prefer

00:02:23.976 --> 00:02:26.379
a more traditional
assault weapon.

00:02:26.379 --> 00:02:29.048
[ Laughter ]

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:31.049
And finally, the makers
of Doritos

00:02:31.049 --> 00:02:33.252
have announced a partnership
with the flavor company

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:37.023
Empirical to offer
a nacho-cheese-flavored alcohol.

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:39.692
It's a perfect way to celebrate
when Maury says,

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:41.460
"You're not the father."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.262
-And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:44.764
We're off and running.
[ Cheers and applause ]

